  "details": "Hello VRChat, I would like to request the implementation of a \"partner\" role. (as special being / important person) to the status in [Social].\nWith this, any users would be able to tell who is his/her partner without verbally saying it. ( no need to explain to others) \nI believe this will ease and may prevent unnecessary dramas or broken hearts.\n\n\nFriends and partnering | Second Life\nhttps://community.secondlife.com/knowledgebase/english/friends-and-partnering-r26/\n\n日本語意訳\nVRchatのプロフィールにSocial画面にパートナ状態を示すものを追加して欲しい。",
